  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessory retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control in assuring that we provide only the highest-quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\nfor 2009-2014 Ford F150 Super Crew Cab\nNote: Please ensure these side step bars fit for your Truck before purchase\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This\nrunning board side step is compatible with the 2009- 2014 Ford F-150\nSuper Crew Cab. Please check the Cab size picture if you do not know the\nmodel of your vehicle\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a\ntextured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to 450\nlb\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and\ndurability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement\nsuch as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with\nrust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent\nperformance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required.\nAll factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to\nfactory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
